data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_nVSunz5P8BPLkHXWVeDIEMwo"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Orin's miners (worker group) [ID: 92474181-bc9f-4dc2-bf64-51e67969f1ea]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them.\n  - â BUYS_FROM from Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines. When the strait freezes in winter, the guild uses stored blue salt.\n  - LOCATED_IN â Orin (island) [ID: 9bac8802-f464-491c-b86e-9c90ec862af2]: An island where blue salt is mined.\n\nLantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines. When the strait freezes in winter, the guild uses stored blue salt.\n  - â MEMBER_OF from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Captain of the courier ship Nightjar; she grew up in Vesper and belongs to the Lantern Guild. Her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She keeps a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - MAINTAINS â Tidal lighthouse of Vesper (lighthouse) [ID: 76dc2022-8211-4657-b177-03c04d118558]: A tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt.\n  - BUYS_FROM â Orin's miners (worker group) [ID: 92474181-bc9f-4dc2-bf64-51e67969f1ea]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them.\n  - USES_STORED â Blue salt (mineral, fuel) [ID: 8f0beecf-61cb-4419-99eb-e2030a4eafb7]: A salt mined on the island of Orin that powers the lenses of Vesper's tidal lighthouse.\n\nBlue salt (mineral, fuel) [ID: 8f0beecf-61cb-4419-99eb-e2030a4eafb7]: A salt mined on the island of Orin that powers the lenses of Vesper's tidal lighthouse.\n  - â USES from Tidal lighthouse of Vesper (lighthouse) [ID: 76dc2022-8211-4657-b177-03c04d118558]: A tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt.\n  - â TRANSPORTS from Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: b0cd3a42-d5b0-44dd-972d-da7d960aab40]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell. It carries blue salt from Orin to Vesper between April and September; winter ice closes the strait.\n  - â USES_STORED from Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines. When the strait freezes in winter, the guild uses stored blue salt.\n  - MINED_ON â Orin (island) [ID: 9bac8802-f464-491c-b86e-9c90ec862af2]: An island where blue salt is mined.\n\nOrin (island) [ID: 9bac8802-f464-491c-b86e-9c90ec862af2]: An island where blue salt is mined.\n  - â MINED_ON from Blue salt (mineral, fuel) [ID: 8f0beecf-61cb-4419-99eb-e2030a4eafb7]: A salt mined on the island of Orin that powers the lenses of Vesper's tidal lighthouse.\n  - â LOCATED_IN from Orin's miners (worker group) [ID: 92474181-bc9f-4dc2-bf64-51e67969f1ea]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them.\n\nTidal lighthouse of Vesper (lighthouse) [ID: 76dc2022-8211-4657-b177-03c04d118558]: A tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt.\n  - â BUILT_AROUND from Vesper (city, port) [ID: 8e5eb323-f581-4ce1-8cf4-8bceb6847598]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - â MAINTAINS from Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines. When the strait freezes in winter, the guild uses stored blue salt.\n  - â LOCATED_BENEATH from Old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse (room, location) [ID: 287f4345-79ad-4e32-9acc-6168a9aafe18]: An old lens room beneath Vesper's tidal lighthouse, opened by Asha Pell's small brass key.\n  - USES â Blue salt (mineral, fuel) [ID: 8f0beecf-61cb-4419-99eb-e2030a4eafb7]: A salt mined on the island of Orin that powers the lenses of Vesper's tidal lighthouse."}]}}

